Package: tftpd-gui
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Franco Conidi <fconidi@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec | policykit-1
Description: TFTP, DHCP and syslog servers for network equipment
 Tftpd-GUI is a graphical tool that puts a TFTP server and client, a staging
 DHCP server and a syslog collector in one window. It is meant for technicians
 who configure switches, routers and access points from a laptop. The servers
 run in a small helper authorized through polkit that stops when the window
 closes.
